# Searches specified text in specified list, redraws the list and sets focus to list
Do $cinst.$findInLists(cFindErrorText,iErrorsRef.$ref,pDirection_opt,pSoundBell_opt) Returns line
If line
	Set reference ref to $cfield.$container().$container().$objs.scrErrorLogStack.$objs.hlErrors
	Do ref.$sendevent(evClick)
	Do ref.$redraw()
	Calculate $ctarget as ref
End If